          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo ababila kimilimo kiewe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese samwene Paulo mwikoonjelela enywe, ese niye balomanga bali ndi omuolu ne ndi nanywe, ne nendi aleeyi mba omurafu khwinywe. Khulwe buolu ne bulayi bwa Kristo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "musaba enywe ndi nga ne niicha mukhambingiilila ndafue tawe, sikila ndi na ng'ali ndi nyala narafwira abo balomanga bali efwe khukholanga kimilimo khuloondekhana ne lilienya lie sibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ali efwe khumenyile mu sibala, ne se khupana nga sibala ne siipana tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulwaani nibwo khurumikhira mwiie liefwe se buli bwe sibala tawe, ne kakhali buli bulwaani bwa Wele bwe bunyali, nibwo khurumikhiranga khukhwonakaka ching'etuuti che kamaani. Khwonakakanga kamayiingamo ke bubeeyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khurusiangao buli sikundula sie khukhwibonia sikhiingililanga bukesi bwa Wele, khuaamba buli mebaasio mala khukakhola karia Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumalile khukhwekesia mu bwichufu buriaani bwenywe, khulerekekha khuukuuma sikholwa siosi siosi sikhali sie buriaani tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulikho muloleelela libonekha lienje lie bibiindu. Aliio omundu ebweeneyo owemanyile ali, ali owa Kristo ku? Bulayi, lekha lundi, omwene eyibaasie sikila akhaba efwe fwesi khuli ba Kristo bulayi bwene nga niye yesi nali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila se ndi ne chisoni tawe, akhaba abulala ne nebonia lukali khulwe bunyali nibwo Omwami akhuelesia efwe, bunyali bwe khumwombakha enywe se buli bwe khumusambuula tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se nenya mbonekhe ndi ndakhakanga khumuriikhirisia enywe ne chibarwa chase tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu mulala anyala aaloma ali, “Chibarwa cha Paulo chili chindafu lundi chindinyu, oli omwene ali alala nafwe, ali omutekhele, ne kamakhuwa kewe se kalimo sisiindu tawe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu nga oyo ario khukhwola amanye ali bubwabukhani se buliio akari we kamakhuwa niko efwe khuandika mu barwa chefwe ne khuli aleeyi nende niko khukhola ne khuli ebweeneyo ne nanywe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ali, efwe se khunyala khwakhaka khukhwefwaanania, namwe khukhwilekhaasia khwaabo babeniinia lukali bario tawe. Se bali ne limanya tawe! Bekholela bikelo bie khukhwilekhaasiakho babeene, mala bekhalakila babeene khuloondekhana ne sikelo siaabwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali efwe, liliebonia liefwe se libira sikelo tawe, liakamila khu sikelo sie kimilimo nikio Wele akhuelesia efwe, kimilimo kiefwe mwinywe kiosi kili mu sikelo sino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sikila enywe mulimo, se khwabira sisiakamo siefwe nga khwecha ewenywe ne khureera Elomo Endayi eya Kristo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono se khweboniselia kimilimo nikio babaandi bakhola kiibira bibiakamo nibio Wele akhurerao efwe tawe. Ne kakhali khwikoomba lisuubila lienywe lichoe mala khube ne khunyala khukhola kimilimo kimiboofu lukali mwinywe buli lwosi mu biakamo nibio Wele akhurerao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, khunyala khwelwacha Elomo Endayi mu bibala bibiindi engelekha, ne se khunyala khweboniselia khu milimo kikholekhe khale mu mukuunda kwo mundu okundi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
